  "label": "Actuarial Communications",
  "shortLabel": "Actuarial Comms",
  "icon": "BarChart3",
  "description": "Transform complex actuarial analyses, reserve reports, and technical findings into clear communications for non-technical stakeholders. Produces board-ready summaries, management reports, and stakeholder briefings that convey actuarial insights in accessible language while maintaining technical accuracy.",
